  <description>PX4-compatible variant of x500_triangular_base: Gazebo-native FLU IMU plus the magnetometer and navsat sensors required by PX4's gz_bridge. Meshes and materials are shared with x500_triangular_base so both stacks simulate the same airframe.</description>
